{"text":"Every day, he made the same deal with himself: gym after work. His bag was packed. Then a meeting ran late, another task landed, and six o’clock became eight. He told himself he would go tomorrow. By Friday, tomorrow had happened four times. A friend showed him Habitnex, an iPhone habit coach that works with your calendar. He could see his plans and ask the coach for a better time to fit his workout. The coach suggested a change. He checked the preview before applying it. A busy day didn’t have to mean giving up the plan. Habitnex is in development. Join the waitlist at Habitnex dot io.","direction":"[natural, conversational, lively] ","voice":"Charlie - Deep, Confident, Energetic","model":"eleven_v4","start":[0,0.06,0.08,0.083,0.086,0.089,0.092,0.095,0.098,0.117,0.135,0.142,0.148,0.154,0.158,0.163,0.168,0.172,0.175,0.178,0.18,0.183,0.185,0.188,0.191,0.209,0.228,0.246,0.25,0.254,0.257,0.261,0.265,0.283,0.302,0.305,0.309,0.313,0.316,0.32,0.4,0.48,0.56,0.64,0.72,0.8,0.88,0.96,1.04,1.06,1.08,1.1,1.12,1.2,1.253,1.307,1.36,1.44,1.5,1.56,1.62,1.68,1.76,1.8,1.84,1.88,1.92,2,2.02,2.04,2.06,2.08,2.16,2.187,2.213,2.24,2.32,2.4,2.48,2.56,2.8,3.04,3.24,3.34,3.44,3.52,3.568,3.616,3.664,3.712,3.76,3.84,3.9,3.96,4.02,4.08,4.32,4.56,4.613,4.667,4.72,4.84,4.88,4.92,4.96,5.04,5.067,5.093,5.12,5.28,5.307,5.333,5.36,5.387,5.413,5.44,5.72,6,6.08,6.16,6.24,6.32,6.4,6.48,6.64,6.663,6.686,6.709,6.731,6.754,6.777,6.8,6.88,6.933,6.987,7.04,7.12,7.16,7.2,7.24,7.28,7.52,7.6,7.646,7.691,7.737,7.783,7.829,7.874,7.92,8.08,8.12,8.16,8.2,8.24,8.32,8.36,8.4,8.44,8.48,8.68,8.88,8.96,9.04,9.067,9.093,9.12,9.2,9.227,9.253,9.28,9.36,9.4,9.44,9.488,9.536,9.584,9.632,9.68,9.76,9.813,9.867,9.92,10,10.08,10.16,10.24,10.288,10.336,10.384,10.432,10.48,10.96,11.04,11.08,11.12,11.16,11.2,11.227,11.253,11.28,11.36,11.413,11.467,11.52,11.58,11.64,11.7,11.76,11.84,11.88,11.92,12,12.016,12.032,12.048,12.064,12.08,12.16,12.2,12.24,12.36,12.4,12.44,12.48,12.528,12.576,12.624,12.672,12.72,13.2,13.32,13.38,13.